d right-sided limits are not equal:\n\n$$\n{lim}_{x\\to (-2)^{-}}f(x)=1,\\,\\,{lim}_{x\\to (-2)^{+}}f(x)=2.\n$$\n\nThese limits both exist and are finite, yet they are not equal. Therefore, the discontinuity at $x=-2$ is a jump discontinuity.\n\nConsequently, II is true, and I and III are false." 13194139534756 true] [17592186307920 1000 #edb/ref 17592186307921 13194139534756 true] [17592186307920 1000 #edb/ref 17592186307922 13194139534756 true] [17592186307920 1000 #edb/ref 17592186307923 13194139534756 true] [17592186307920 1000 #edb/ref 17592186307924 13194139534756 true] [17592186307920 1000 #edb/ref 17592186307925 13194139534756 true] [17592186307920 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534756 true] [17592186307920 1041 "selection" 13194139534756 true] [17592186307920 1104 #edb/ref 17592186307925 13194139534756 true] [17592186307920 1110 #uuid "940e0936-d7e3-5b08-9611-25bcabaceac3" 13194139534756 true] [17592186307921 1034 "II and III only" 13194139534756 true] [17592186307921 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534756 true] [17592186307921 1111 #uuid "eb331c7b-7a6d-53a1-9717-62f4a371ae7c" 13194139534756 true] [17592186307922 1034 "I and III only" 13194139534756 true] [17592186307922 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534756 true] [17592186307922 1111 #uuid "6294b263-59a7-56d7-84d5-4f97b2ef5fcb" 13194139534756 true] [17592186307923 1034 "I only" 13194139534756 true] [17592186307923 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534756 true] [17592186307923 1111 #uuid "485cae68-ccb0-5289-aec8-cee3e919c42f" 13194139534756 true] [17592186307924 1034 "III only" 13194139534756 true] [17592186307924 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534756 true] [17592186307924 1111 #uuid "f6546cb1-dd43-5bfc-adb4-77f5b86a9bc6" 13194139534756 true] [17592186307925 1034 "II only" 13194139534756 true] [17592186307925 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534756 true] [17592186307925 1111 #uuid "d00ccab5-32c8-5994-ae8f-21a4e25027c0" 13194139534756 true] [17592186307926 1017 #edb/ref 17592186